<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Exceptions on Selenium</title><link>https://www.selenium.dev/tags/exceptions/</link><description>Recent content in Exceptions on Selenium</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Apr 2023 08:49:56 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.selenium.dev/tags/exceptions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>InvalidSelectorException has changed</title><link>https://www.selenium.dev/blog/2023/invalid-selector-exception-has-changed/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.selenium.dev/blog/2023/invalid-selector-exception-has-changed/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Before Selenium 4.8.2 in Java and C#, when an invalid locator was used to identify an element, the resulting behavior would be
inconsistent in our bindings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For example, let&amp;rsquo;s check the following code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;ArrayList&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;Class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;lt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold"&gt;extends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;Exception&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;ArrayList&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;openqa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;selenium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;NoSuchElementException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;openqa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;selenium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;StaleElementReferenceException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;openqa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;selenium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;ElementNotInteractableException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;openqa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;selenium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;InvalidElementStateException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;FluentWait&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;driver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;withTimeout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;Duration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;ofMillis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;ELEMENT_IDENTIFICATION_TIMEOUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;pollingEvery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;Duration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;ofMillis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;ELEMENT_IDENTIFICATION_POLLING_DELAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;ignoreAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;expectedExceptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;until&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;nestedDriver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;nestedDriver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;findElement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000"&gt;By&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;xpath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06"&gt;&amp;#34;invalid-xpath&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;)).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c4a000"&gt;click&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f8f8f8"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected result &lt;em&gt;before this change&lt;/em&gt; would be that the driver waits until the timeout expires and then throw an &lt;code&gt;InvalidSelectorException&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>